{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KcR1N1-_BB1TAVNFm8O_4Q","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:22.841319+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KcR1N1-_BB1TAVNFm8O_4Q","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/az1KshflZrruFicMu49ZDPedCLxtg6wBe2WZsFxQyiclprSIxeI9yKCOKav2c4mrNozB7iczdJyJ6CzcSnDWpxib7hDgor6qiaGKPmEV1Uk86oWY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>2026年</span></p></section><section><p><strong><span>暑期科研体验营</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><p><em><span>- Summer Research Experience Camp -</span></em></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为拓宽青年学子的学术视野、激发科研探索热情，助力学子深入了解清华大学生物医学交叉研究院（TIMBR）/北京生命科学研究所（NIBS）在生命科学、基础医学以及生物医学交叉领域的前沿方向与最新研究进展，清华大学生物医学交叉研究院（北京生命科学研究所），拟定于 2026 年 7 月 6 日 —7 月 9 日举办2026 年“暑期科研体验营”活动。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>本次暑期科研体验营旨在搭建高水平、国际化的学术交流平台，推动不同高校、不同学科背景青年学子的深度沟通与学术互鉴；系统展示 NIBS 在细胞死亡、免疫防御、发育调控、疾病机制与药物发现等核心方向的原创科研成果与前沿发展布局；鼓励优秀本科生与科研导师面对面交流研讨，助力学子明晰学术志趣、沉浸式体验科研氛围、拓展学术人脉，深入探索生命科学的奥秘与魅力。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>本活动计划邀请约200人参加，申请工作从即日起开始。暑期科研体验营主办方将为参营人员提供活动期间内的食宿和外地学校学生往返硬座火车票费用（需有发票），如乘坐其它交通工具，仅报销火车硬座的票价。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/az1KshflZrp59qiasvdoNPTgNKIMZbHq8MZG5rf7dXpFEgBhoLO2sjEA88STdrmtSjNWN1fKicFVvcS6QKfPQ6bRHewvsHQkYjk5LpicemRQew/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>一、体验营活动内容</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/Q3auHgzwzM7EcBbtaHkyyjpW61aXZBKiaPicGI9v9dz78CyFhnHUvLCeqibnofqEvBhUld8KnFG44zf8B2Sbn1Yc6gAqibEJaxWwy4k27FAbN0DIajbkXcicnlg/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>1.走进实验室，直观感受科研环境，了解学科前沿动态。</span></p><p><span>2.自主选择感兴趣的研究方向，与领域名师面对面交流，激发学术志趣。</span></p><p><span>3.分享科研经历与学习心得，拓展学术视野，在交流中碰撞思维火花。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、报名参与条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/Q3auHgzwzM4YphQE37ssh92SwH8ib0iaxP6HsbJtqE5PHgYTibymExzwduCSIiaXHqAmR9We7014EOhbY6e8PqgyGpANfLhiboJD6leGFrAovBuLTqZyYrgpBfw/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>1.全国各高校生命科学及相关学科本科三年级学生（2023级）。</span></p><p><span>2.本科前五学期学业成绩优异，专业基础扎实。</span></p><p><span>3.对生命科学研究具有浓厚兴趣，具备较强的学习与探索能力，乐于参与学术交流。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、报名方式及时间</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/Q3auHgzwzM4oSLvncQnuhQVV1ZvRojFJQhukNSqicadaLJLrGOH8Iz2B7hibCClauyNnWxsicTlXKOJPI5bsiancZElSExsCpAld3iaaqlz0rssw9QE14bpb1aA/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>请有意向参加本次暑期科研体验营的同学，于2026 年 6 月 20 日 17:00 前，登录报名系统：https://graduate.nibs.ac.cn/tms 完成注册、登录，按要求填写报名信息并提交相关材料。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、报名后续安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/Q3auHgzwzM7xswGGibxVAIbtDd2WY0eflaicrpUibG3lJKHiaUWhg6cJicc413QwXiag7biaSwibXCXqWT74NWemVJYzBscicyrdfibHDHXH2hxXk4VU0oyPb1VRXRUg/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>因场地容量有限，报名截止后，研究所将对申请材料进行审核，仅向受邀同学发送邮件通知，并同步在报名系统更新邀请状态，请及时查收邮件或登录系统查看结果。未入选者不再另行通知。 </span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、其他注意事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/Q3auHgzwzM78o8HWa2dZgtfCNole949dCBoH9fVZmGIGKvuicDkSFd5PbkSFOGjAYzsXrmsZQibleupPRdOGUjXFodgQicY84qxDlQcEqDfnWemP7nCCNCugA/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>1.申请人须确保所提交的报名信息及全部材料真实、准确。若存在弄虚作假等情况，一经核实，立即取消参与资格。</span></p><p><span>2.本次体验营唯一报名渠道为官方系统：https://graduate.nibs.ac.cn/tms，每个身份证号仅限注册一次，请妥善保管用户名、密码及注册邮箱。</span></p><p><span>3.报名信息核对无误后点击 “确认提交”，提交后信息不可修改。材料不全将被退回，补全后需重新提交，请及时关注系统与邮件提醒。</span></p><p><span>4.是否参加本次暑期科研体验营，不影响后续推荐免试研究生的申请与评审。</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、信息查询及联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_svg/Q3auHgzwzM6ydnOTgVAYiaSXysT6yeK47YbNyss5kBclxXjHtn9sKBWicqGXcCviaQl9pEhqWj2yIAq6GicBPiakzLh0Uu9ZMQz017J5SHNLuicicxxngAYF5nDGg/640?wx_fmt=svg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>官方信息发布网址：http://nibs.ac.cn/yjsjylist.php?cid=8&amp;sid=26&amp;zid=78</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>咨询邮箱：education@nibs.ac.cn</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>联系电话：010-80706021 / 010-80726688-8802</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>联系人：李老师、武老师</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/az1KshflZroSl0gr8vy9VEIIg8TJDeB2fiaUZibEIKBibd7ic8o4b18pQl19bV2EH82ugjGpDmopHwMMV9BvCHTaV0zNot3JTelEh4wfWYr24KU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>微信号｜</span></strong></span><span>北京生命科学研究所</span></p><p><span><strong><span>官网｜</span></strong></span><span>http://www.nibs.ac.cn/</span></p></section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"8385c3e4bf821993ced336a23d737691b55b9975619f03d0f7f64242a2c503a2","textLength":1287,"sourceSha256":"0d3c2f2168c6e42dde2129e4a35a